  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility study for introducing Sustainable Fisheries in Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the feasibility study is to deliver a study containing a thorough insight in the needed investments (both in techniques and capacity) for improving the sustainability and high value productivity of the Indonesian fishery supply chain at Cilacap.This study has to deliver a good picture about the technical, environmental and economic aspects of the potential investments. Based on this report, a decision regarding financial support can be taken.</narrative>
  </description>
